INT. SEAGULL - CONTINUOUS

TREPLIEFF sits down and begins to cry softly.

Walking up and down in great excitement.

ARKADINA
Don’t cry! You mustn’t cry!

She bursts into tears.

ARKADINA
You really mustn’t.

She kisses his forehead, his cheeks, his head.

ARKADINA
My darling child, forgive me. Forgive your wicked mother.

Embracing her.

TREPLIEFF
Oh, if you could only know what it is to have lost everything under heaven! She does not love me. I see I shall never be able to write. Every hope has deserted me.

ARKADINA
Don’t despair. This will all pass. He is going away to-day, and she will love you once more.

She wipes away his tears.

ARKADINA
Stop crying. We have made peace again.

Kissing her hand.

TREPLIEFF
Yes, mother.

Tenderly.

ARKADINA
Make your peace with him, too. Don’t fight with him. You surely won’t fight?

TREPLIEFF
I won’t, but you must not insist on my seeing him again, mother, I couldn’t stand it.

TRIGORIN comes in.

TREPLIEFF
There he is; I am going.

He quickly puts the medicines away in the cupboard.

TREPLIEFF
The doctor will attend to my head.

Looking through the pages of a book.

TRIGORIN
Page 121, lines 11 and 12; here it is.

He reads.

TRIGORIN
“If at any time you should have need of my life, come and take it.”

TREPLIEFF picks up the bandage off the floor and goes out.

Looking at her watch.

ARKADINA
The carriage will soon be here.

To himself.

TRIGORIN
If at any time you should have need of my life, come and take it.

ARKADINA
I hope your things are all packed.

Impatiently.

TRIGORIN
Yes, yes.

In deep thought.

TRIGORIN
Why do I hear a note of sadness that wrings my heart in this cry of a pure soul? If at any time you should have need of my life, come and take it.

To ARKADINA.

TRIGORIN
Let us stay here one more day!

ARKADINA shakes her head.

TRIGORIN
Do let us stay!

ARKADINA
I know, dearest, what keeps you here, but you must control yourself. Be sober; your emotions have intoxicated you a little.

TRIGORIN
You must be sober, too. Be sensible; look upon what has happened as a true friend would.

Taking her hand.

TRIGORIN
You are capable of self-sacrifice. Be a friend to me and release me!

In deep excitement.

ARKADINA
Are you so much in love?
